<title>USA: HealthTech Intl Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>HealthTech Intl Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MESA, Ariz. 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997	 1996   Growth</p>
<p> Gross Revenues		     $6,143,000 $1,204,000    511%</p>
<p> Operational Profit (Loss)	 1,548,000  (330,568)</p>
<p>Earnings (loss) per share before taxes  0.24  (0.09)</p>
<p> Net Income			    1,022,000     81,825  1,249%</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share			 0.16	 0.02    800%</p>
<p>Weighted Average Shares Outstanding6.53 million 3.75 million</p>
<p>HealthTech International, Inc. is pleased to announce fiscal 1997 second quarter operational profits of $.24 per share, as compared to a loss of $(.09) per share for 2nd quarter 1996.  Total gross revenues have increased by 511% to approximately $6,143,000 for the Company's fiscal second quarter ended March 31, 1997, as compared to $1,204,000 for the same period ended March 31, 1996.</p>
</text>
